From 991c908e38f0958ab64bf6526b57ddb86e125674 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Gemini Mainline Experiment <gemini-mainline@example.invalid>
Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 18:21:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] soc: mediatek: add one-shot CPU8 admission controller

Gate one exact source-derived transaction through binder readiness,
publish P17/P18, and synchronously request CPU8 from the same task.
